This repository includes derived data artifacts under results/ (model outputs
from the attention-suppression runs, chain-of-thought strategy labels, the
answer-position control, and attention-marker arrays). These artifacts are built
on the KaBLE benchmark and, where they contain model text, quote the claims from
KaBLE items.

KaBLE (Belief in the Machine: Investigating Epistemological Blind Spots of
Language Models), Mirac Suzgun et al.
https://github.com/suzgunmirac/belief-in-the-machine

